id=m11-props
name=M11 identity props
version=2
versionCode=2
author=fiio-m11
description=Before zygote: ro.build.tags=release-keys (FiiO signs with AOSP test-keys, which apps such as Apple Music refuse) and ro.serialno/ro.boot.serialno from the Exynos chip ID (FiiO leaves them empty, so apps see "unknown" and Apple Music's device ID is all zeros). Fingerprint is left alone.
